# Watphou Travels — Project Memory Rule

Before starting work, read:
1. `AGENTS.md`
2. `docs/project_memory/AGENT_ONBOARDING.md`
3. `docs/project_memory/CURRENT_STATE.md`
4. `docs/project_memory/TASKS.md`

After completing meaningful work, update in the same commit:
- `docs/project_memory/CURRENT_STATE.md` — status, done, next actions
- `docs/project_memory/TASKS.md` — task statuses
- `docs/project_memory/DECISIONS.md` — if a new decision was made
- `docs/project_memory/TEST_LOG.md` — if tests were run

Never commit secrets, invoice PDFs, bank documents, or the backup ZIP.
Never modify the live Wix site or the existing smbistro app on the demo VPS.
